From 6f690e3edbf7af84a9d4c2bed77168c780016b09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vishnu Saini <vishnu.saini@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:15:14 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] FROMLIST: arm64: defconfig: Enable RPi touchscreen V2
 regulator and ILI9881C panel

Enable the regulator driver for the Raspberry Pi touchscreen V2 power
and backlight controller, and the Ilitek ILI9881C DSI panel driver, as
modules, for the Raspberry Pi 7 inch DSI panel on the 22-pin JDISP1 DSI0
connector on Qualcomm Shikra EVK, Talos Lyra EVK boards.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261021-shikra_display_overlays-v1-4-adaea735999f@oss.qualcomm.com/]
Signed-off-by: Vishnu Saini <vishnu.saini@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261021-shikra_display_overlays-v1-4-adaea735999f@oss.qualcomm.com/
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 6ec8d3a69c98..1259b03a28d7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -893,6 +893,7 @@ CONFIG_REGULATOR_QCOM_SMD_RPM=y
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_QCOM_SPMI=y
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_QCOM_USB_VBUS=m
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_RAA215300=y
+CONFIG_REGULATOR_RASPBERRYPI_TOUCHSCREEN_V2=m
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_RK808=y
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_S2MPS11=y
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_TPS65132=m
@@ -1018,6 +1019,7 @@ CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_LVDS=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_HIMAX_HX8279=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_HIMAX_HX83112A=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_HIMAX_HX83112B=m
+CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_ILITEK_ILI9881C=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_ILITEK_ILI9882T=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_KHADAS_TS050=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_MANTIX_MLAF057WE51=m
-- 
2.34.1
